article.common-document
  header.header
    h2.title BBJ1K dataset
  .contents
    section.section
      h3.sectiontitle Summary
      p.body
        | BBJ1K contains allele and genotype frequencies derived from whole-genome sequencing (WGS) data
        | for 1,026 participants enrolled in
        |
        a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://biobankjp.org/english/index.html') BioBank Japan
        | between fiscal years 2003 and 2007. TogoVar provides the frequencies on GRCh38.
      ul.unordered-list
        li Sample size: 1,026
        li Reference genome: GRCh38
        li Number of alternate alleles searchable in TogoVar: 44,694,482
        li
          | Source data:
          |
          a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://humandbs.dbcls.jp/en/dataset/JGAD000220') JGAD000220
        li
          | Joint-called WGS data:
          |
          a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://humandbs.dbcls.jp/en/dataset/JGAD000758') JGAD000758
        li
          | GRCh38 imputation reference panel:
          |
          a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://humandbs.dbcls.jp/en/dataset/JGAD000867') JGAD000867

    section.section
      h3.sectiontitle Data processing
      p.body
        | The NBDC Human Database processed and quality-controlled the per-sample WGS data from the 1,026 participants
        | in JGAD000220, then performed joint calling separately for autosomes and chrX PAR regions, female chrX
        | non-PAR regions, and male chrXY non-PAR regions.
      ul.unordered-list
        li Per-sample processing: January 16, 2022
        li Quality control: February 24, 2022
        li Joint calling for autosomes and chrX PAR regions: January 30, 2023
        li Joint calling for female chrX non-PAR regions: February 25, 2023
        li Joint calling for male chrXY non-PAR regions: March 2, 2023
      p.body
        | See the NBDC Human Database page for
        |
        a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://humandbs.dbcls.jp/en/processed-data-wgs') processed whole-genome sequencing data
        | for the source dataset and processing dates.

    section.section
      h3.sectiontitle Related processed data
      p.body
        | JGAD000758 is also included in TogoVar as a dataset-specific frequency under JGA-WGS. A GRCh38 imputation
        | reference panel from the same 1,026 participants (JGAD000867) is listed on the NBDC Human Database page for
        |
        a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://humandbs.dbcls.jp/en/processed-data-imputation') processed imputation reference data
        | .

    section.section
      h3.sectiontitle Terms of use
      p.body
        | Aggregated frequencies in TogoVar are publicly viewable. To use the source data or controlled-access
        | processed data, specify JGAD000220 and the relevant processed dataset ID when applying through
        |
        a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://humandbs.dbcls.jp/en/data-use') Data Use
        | .
